00:31:23,420 --> 00:31:28,360
followed a cloud through the desert that literally dropped food on the ground for them.

466
00:31:28,360 --> 00:31:29,800
And yet they doubt God.

467
00:31:29,800 --> 00:31:30,920
Sounds a lot like us.

468
00:31:30,920 --> 00:31:36,220
But he, again, God's showing his power to them.

469
00:31:36,220 --> 00:31:38,740
So Moses has just been given the Ten Commandments.

470
00:31:38,740 --> 00:31:39,820
He comes off Mount Sinai.

471
00:31:39,820 --> 00:31:41,640
And God is showing himself to the Israelites.

472
