00:32:23,640 --> 00:32:27,380
We have to remember the power that our God holds.

488
00:32:27,380 --> 00:32:32,940
And they needed, unfortunately, another reminder that came in the form of lightning and thunder and clouds.

489
00:32:32,940 --> 00:32:35,060
Sometimes I think we would all love a little bit of that.

