00:32:35,060 --> 00:32:38,800
But he's saying, you don't need to be afraid of your God, like scared of him.

491
00:32:38,800 --> 00:32:43,840
But you do need to respect him and have reverence for him.

492
00:32:43,840 --> 00:32:45,900
Because we are not God's.

493
00:32:45,900 --> 00:32:56,260
Isaiah 40, 12 said, who has measured the waters in the hallows of his hand and marked off the heavens, calculated the dust of the earth and weighed the mountain?

494
00:32:56,960 --> 00:32:57,520
Not me.

495
00:32:57,520 --> 00:32:58,520
Not even close.

496
00:32:58,520 --> 00:32:59,240
Not even close.

497
00:32:59,240 --> 00:33:00,520
That's God.

498
00:33:00,520 --> 00:33:09,440
And we sometimes get so used to being in control that we stop remembering that we are not God's.

499
00:33:09,440 --> 00:33:12,780
It is not our will on earth as it is in heaven.

500
00:33:12,780 --> 00:33:16,120
It is God's will on earth as it is in heaven.

501
00:33:16,600 --> 00:33:20,100
And we need to remember that, especially when it comes to our works.

