00:33:37,720 --> 00:33:49,120
To know that in the depths of our souls, to know that God works all things for the good, even that awful thing that happens to you,

506
00:33:49,120 --> 00:33:55,040
to understand that is how you get a peace that passes all understanding.

507
00:33:56,360 --> 00:34:01,260
So now that we, I've talked about that, and we know the power of God, and we know the reverence,

