00:36:35,120 --> 00:36:39,860
Anyone who is never at fault at what they say is perfect, able to keep their whole body in check.

563
00:36:39,860 --> 00:36:45,540
Okay, so, I said that that was confusing because we have so many other things that can be considered sin.

564
00:36:45,660 --> 00:36:48,800
So, how does being able to control your tongue make you perfect?

