571
00:37:22,080 --> 00:37:27,820
Do we really believe that he has it all and that he will do justice in due time?

572
00:37:27,900 --> 00:37:32,520
Do we really believe that he has a plan and that that person that hurts you is loved by him?

573
00:37:32,520 --> 00:37:35,120
And it's, he doesn't, it's not that he misses it.

574
00:37:35,120 --> 00:37:38,660
It's not that you're not ever, that your sadness isn't okay.

