576
00:37:41,160 --> 00:37:45,880
But the comfort has to come from him, not from us repaying evil from evil.

577
00:37:46,540 --> 00:37:48,400
What is in our hearts?

578
00:37:48,400 --> 00:37:54,340
Because that is why, if we are able to control our tongue, we can keep our whole body in check and we're perfect.

579
00:37:54,340 --> 00:38:01,060
Because if you can be able to control your tongue, that means that you have thought about what you're going to say.

