605
00:40:07,380 --> 00:40:18,540
Dear God, I thank you so much for these words, for reminding us that you are the one who provides the justice that we so deserve because we won't do it right.

606
00:40:18,540 --> 00:40:19,640
We can't.

607
00:40:19,640 --> 00:40:26,460
